id: zw_true_status
label: True Status Engine
category: Z-Wave
description: >
  The True Status Engine is used by the application framework. This module is used to notify the
  Lifeline (or any other association groups) of state changes for any Command Class.
  A state change can be triggered by a command from a remote note, or by a local change such as a button press.
package: zwave
quality: production
metadata:
  sbom:
    reference: zw_sbom_license

source:
- path: ZAF/ApplicationUtilities/TrueStatusEngine/ZAF_TSE.c
provides:
- name: zw_true_status

config_file:
- path: ZAF/ApplicationUtilities/TrueStatusEngine/config/zaf_tse_config.h
  file_id: zaf_tse_config
root_path: zwave
